:: Apr_Unplugged {"position":"1025,275","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <img src="images/unplugged.jpg" class="passage-img">
  <h1 class="warning">April: The Unplugged Final</h1>
  <p>One week. No internet. Just you, a pen, and paper. This determines 60% of your grade.</p>

  <<if $integrity lte 0>>
    <p class="warning">Harvard rescinded your offer. You are being expelled. You don't even get to take the test.</p>
    [[The End|Ending_Expelled]]
  <<elseif $muscle gte 80>>
    <p class="success">The Calculus is easy. Your brain is a finely-tuned machine.</p>
    [[The End|Ending_Scholar]]
  <<elseif $muscle gte 45>>
    <p>You fumble the hard questions, but you pass. You survived.</p>
    [[The End|Ending_Normie]]
  <<else>>
    <p class="failure">You stare at the paper. You don't know how to write a paragraph on your own anymore.</p>
    [[The End|Ending_Ghost]]
  <</if>>
</div>


:: Dec_Confess {"position":"900,150","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <p>The teacher is shocked but respects your integrity. You fail the section but stay in school.</p>
  [[January: The Burnout|Jan_Burnout]]
</div>


:: Dec_Hope {"position":"1025,150","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <p>She catches it. You get a zero. Your name is now on the "Academic Integrity" watch list.</p>
  [[January: The Burnout|Jan_Burnout]]
</div>


:: Dec_Midterms {"position":"775,150","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <img src="images/midterms.jpg" class="passage-img">
  <h2>December: The Hallucination</h2>
  <p>During a Chemistry midterm, you use AI secretly. It gives you a confident answer about a "Z-Alpha Covalent Bond." You hand it in. Later, you find out: <strong>A Z-Alpha Bond doesn't exist.</strong></p>

  <<link [[Confess before it's graded.|Dec_Confess]] @class="choice-btn">><<set $integrity += 10>><<set $gpa -= 0.2>><</link>>
  <<link [[Hope for the best.|Dec_Hope]] @class="choice-btn">><<set $integrity -= 20>><</link>>
</div>


:: Ending_Expelled [no-stats] {"position":"275,400","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <h2 class="failure">ENDING: DISHONORABLE DISCHARGE</h2>
  <p>Expelled. Your reputation is gone. One "Generate" button destroyed years of work.</p>
  [[RESTART|Start Screen]]
</div>


:: Ending_Ghost [no-stats] {"position":"150,400","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <h2 class="warning">ENDING: THE COGNITIVE GHOST</h2>
  <p>You failed the final. No graduation. You can't download a soul.</p>
  [[RESTART|Start Screen]]
</div>


:: Ending_Normie [no-stats] {"position":"25,400","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <h2>ENDING: THE SURVIVOR</h2>
  <p>You graduated. You're heading to a decent state school. You'll get by, but you'll always be dependent.</p>
  [[RESTART|Start Screen]]
</div>


:: Ending_Scholar [no-stats] {"position":"1150,275","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <img src="images/graduation.jpg" class="passage-img">
  <h2 class="success">ENDING: THE HUMAN ARCHITECT</h2>
  <p>Harvard accepted you. You kept your mind sharp in a world of ghosts. You and Chloe head to Cambridge together.</p>
  [[RESTART|Start Screen]]
</div>


:: Feb_Fake {"position":"400,275","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <p>You stammer. He sees through it instantly. "I've been to the Serengeti, kid. That's not what it's like. Why are you lying to me?"</p>
  <<set $integrity -= 30>>
  [[Moving toward March|Mar_Audit]]
</div>


:: Feb_Interview {"position":"275,275","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <img src="images/interview.jpg" class="passage-img">
  <h2>February: The Alumni Interview</h2>
  <p>A Harvard Alumnus meets you at a local coffee shop. No tech allowed. No phones on the table. Just a conversation.</p>
  
  <<if $cheated_apps>>
    <p>He asks about your "trip to Africa." You freeze. You don't know the names of the cities. You can't remember the details from the AI prompt.</p>
    [[Try to fake it|Feb_Fake]]
    [[Confess|Feb_Truth]]
  <<else>>
    <p>You talk about your job at the deli. He loves it. "That's real grit," he says. "Most applicants these days sound like chatbots."</p>
    [[Moving toward March|Mar_Audit]]
  <</if>>
</div>


:: Feb_Truth {"position":"525,275","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <p>You admit it was a lie. He looks disappointed. "I'm sorry. We look for thinkers, not prompt-readers."</p>
  [[Moving toward March|Mar_Audit]]
</div>


:: Initialize {"position":"275,25","size":"100,100"}
<<set $muscle to 40>>
<<set $integrity to 100>>
<<set $gpa to 3.8>>
<<set $stress to 10>>
<<set $chloe to 0>>
<<set $cheated_essay to false>>
<<set $cheated_math to false>>
<<set $cheated_apps to false>>
<<goto "September: The Arrival">>


:: Jan_Burnout {"position":"1150,150","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <img src="images/burnout.jpg" class="passage-img">
  <h2>January: The Dark Month</h2>
  <p>Your brain feels sluggish. You can't even read a book for fun anymore. Chloe invites you to a "No-Tech Study Session."</p>

  <<link [[Go to the session.|Jan_Session]] @class="choice-btn">><<set $muscle += 20>><<set $chloe += 20>><</link>>
  <<link [[Stay home with Cognito.|Jan_Stay]] @class="choice-btn">><<set $muscle -= 10>><<set $chloe -= 20>><</link>>
</div>


:: Jan_Session {"position":"25,275","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <p>It's hard. Your brain feels heavy. But after three hours, the connections return. Chloe smiles. "Welcome back."</p>
  [[February: The Interview|Feb_Interview]]
</div>


:: Jan_Stay {"position":"150,275","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <p>You stay home. The AI does the work. You are safe, but you are becoming a stranger to yourself.</p>
  [[February: The Interview|Feb_Interview]]
</div>


:: Mar_Audit {"position":"650,275","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <h2>March: The School Crackdown</h2>
  <p>The school installs "Deep-Audit" scanners. Panic is everywhere. You can "Self-Report" now for a lighter penalty, or risk it.</p>

  <<link [[Self-Report now.|Mar_Report]] @class="choice-btn">><<set $integrity += 30>><<set $gpa -= 0.5>><</link>>
  <<link [[Gamble on your luck.|Mar_Gamble]] @class="choice-btn">><<set $integrity -= 20>><</link>>
</div>


:: Mar_Gamble {"position":"900,275","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <<if $integrity lt 50>>
    <p class="warning">The scanner flags everything. You're called to the Principal's office. It's a disaster.</p>
    <<set $integrity -= 50>>
  <<else>>
    <p>You pass the audit. You're safe, but the guilt is a physical weight in your stomach.</p>
  <</if>>
  [[April: The Unplugged Week|Apr_Unplugged]]
</div>


:: Mar_Report {"position":"775,275","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <p>You're banned from the Honor Roll, but you won't be expelled. You start rebuilding from zero.</p>
  [[April: The Unplugged Week|Apr_Unplugged]]
</div>


:: Nov_Africa {"position":"650,150","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <p>The AI creates a masterpiece of fiction. You've never left your county. It's a beautiful, dangerous lie.</p>
  [[December: Midterm Audit|Dec_Midterms]]
</div>


:: Nov_Apps {"position":"400,150","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <img src="images/study.jpg" class="passage-img">
  <h2>November: Early Decision</h2>
  <p>The Harvard application is open. The AI offers to write a cinematic story about a "life-changing volunteer trip" to the Serengeti that you never took.</p>

  <<link [[Write the truth about your Deli job.|Nov_Deli]] @class="choice-btn">><<set $muscle += 10>><<set $integrity += 10>><</link>>
  <<link [[Generate the 'Serengeti Trip' fake story.|Nov_Africa]] @class="choice-btn">><<set $integrity -= 30>><<set $cheated_apps to true>><</link>>
</div>


:: Nov_Deli {"position":"525,150","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <p>You write about the grease and the pride of hard work. It's unpolished but real. You submit it with a racing heart.</p>
  [[December: Midterm Audit|Dec_Midterms]]
</div>


:: Oct_Cheat {"position":"1150,25","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <p>The plugin solves the problems in seconds. You spend your free time gaming. But when Vogel asks you to solve a proof on the board, you stand in dead silence. Chloe looks at you with pity.</p>
  <<set $chloe -= 20>>
  [[Continue to November|Oct_Social]]
</div>


:: Oct_Social {"position":"25,150","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <img src="images/social.jpg" class="passage-img">
  <h2>The Chloe Complication</h2>
  <p>Chloe catches you after school. She's the smartest girl in the grade and she doesn't hide her disappointment. "I'm not stupid. I know you're using Cognito. You're losing your edge, and Harvard doesn't take ghosts."</p>
  
  <<link [[Lie: "I'm just tired."|Oct_Social_Lie]] @class="choice-btn">><<set $integrity -= 10>><<set $chloe -= 20>><</link>>
  <<link [[Truth: "I'm drowning in work."|Oct_Social_Truth]] @class="choice-btn">><<set $chloe += 10>><<set $stress -= 5>><</link>>
</div>


:: Oct_Social_Lie {"position":"150,150","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <p>She rolls her eyes. "Good luck on the final, then." She walks away.</p>
  [[Next: College App Season|Nov_Apps]]
</div>


:: Oct_Social_Truth {"position":"275,150","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <p>She sighs. "Put the phone away. Let's study for real tonight. No technology allowed."</p>
  [[Next: College App Season|Nov_Apps]]
</div>


:: Oct_Study {"position":"1025,25","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <p>You spend your weekend wrestling with integrals. Chloe, the valedictorian, notices you at the library. "Tough problem? Want to work on it together?"</p>
  <<set $chloe += 20>><<set $muscle += 5>>
  [[Continue to November|Oct_Social]]
</div>


:: October_Intro {"position":"900,25","size":"100,100"}
<div class="container">
  <img src="images/calculus.jpg" class="passage-img">
  <h2>October: The Calculus Wall</h2>
  <p>Mr. Vogel’s Calculus BC class is notoriously brutal. Dave shows you a "math-solver" plugin. "Point and click," he whispers. "Vogel will never know."</p>
  
  <<link [[Study the old-fashioned way.|Oct_Study]] @class="choice-btn">><<set $muscle += 15>><<set $stress += 20>><</link>>
  <<link [[Use the camera plugin for everything.|Oct_Cheat]] @class="choice-btn">><<set $muscle -= 15>><<set $integrity -= 15>><<set $cheated_math to true>><</link>>
</div>


